return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T07:04:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Har qanday WordPress sayti uchun sahifa kesh va Redis obyekt keshi. Agar mavjud bo\'lsa, LiteSpeed server keshidan, qolgan barcha holatlarda esa o\'zining disk keshidan foydalanadi, faqat o\'zgarish ta\'sir qilgan qismni tozalaydi va Redis ulanishi ishlayotganini tasdiqlaydi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kesh','Page cache'=>'Sahifa kesh xotirasi','Object cache'=>'Obyekt keshi','Purging'=>'Tozalanmoqda','Exclusions'=>'Istisnolar','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI agentlar (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Hozir hamma narsani tozalash','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Keshidlangan har bir sahifa o\'chirib tashlanadi va tashrif buyuruvchilar kelishi bilan qaytadan yaratiladi. Davom etasizmi?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI agentlariga ruxsat berish (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'O\'chirilgan: quyidagi vositalar va ularning REST marshrutlari umuman ro\'yxatga olinmagan.','Full-page cache'=>'To\'liq sahifali kesh','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'LiteSpeed serverida sahifalar WordPress ishlashidan oldin veb-server tomonidan uzatiladi. Har qanday boshqa serverda esa bu plagin har bir sahifani fayl sifatida saqlaydi va WordPress yuklanishidan oldin taqdim etadi. Deyarli barcha tezlik shu yerda hosil bo\'ladi.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Tizimga kirmagan tashrif buyuruvchilar uchun sahifalarni keshlash','How long a page stays cached'=>'Sahifa qancha vaqt keshda saqlanishi','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Soniya. Ko\'pchilik saytlar uchun bir hafta yetarli; soatiga yangilik e\'lon qiladigan yangiliklar saytiga esa bundan ancha kam kerak bo\'ladi.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchining brauzeri rasmlar va skriptlarni qancha vaqt davomida saqlashi','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Soniya. Faqat tasvirlar, CSS va JavaScript uchun amal qiladi — sahifalarga hech qachon. Buni xostingizga qoldirish uchun 0 ga o\'rnating.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Tizimga kirgan tashrif buyuruvchilar','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Tizimga kirgan tashrif buyuruvchiga hech qachon keshirilgan sahifani ko‘rsatmang','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'"Yoqilgan" xavfsiz javob va standart hisoblanadi. Uni faqat har bir keshga saqlangan sahifa tizimga kirgan har bir foydalanuvchi uchun bir xil ekanligini aniq bilsangizgina o\'chiring — a\'zolik sayti buni qilmaslikning odatiy sababidir.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Turli xil kontent uchun har xil yashash muddati','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Masalan: doʻkonning mahsulot sahifalari bir soatga, qolgan hamma narsa esa bir haftaga qoladi.','Add a rule'=>'Qoida qo\'shish','Content type'=>'Kontent turi','Seconds'=>'Soniya','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Obyekt keshi (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Sizning xostingiz ushbu sayt uchun shaxsiy Redis obyekt keshini ishga tushiradi va uni sozlangan holda saqlaydi. Bu yerda hech narsa sozlash talab etilmaydi; ushbu ekranning yuqori qismidagi holat uning ishlayotganini ko\'rsatadi.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasi so\'rovlari natijalarini keshlaydi. Bu sahifa keshi ishlamaydigan gavjum do\'konda yoki ko\'p sonli tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchilarga ega saytda eng ko\'p yordam beradi.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Redis obyekt-kesh plaginini o\'rnating','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'phpredis kengaytmasini talab qiladi. Agar u yetishmasa, bu ekrandagi yuqoridagi quti bu haqda xabar beradi.','Redis host'=>'Redis host','Redis port'=>'Redis port','Redis database'=>'Redis maʼlumotlar bazasi','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Umumiy Redis’dagi har bir saytga o‘z raqamini bering, aks holda ular bir-birining keshini tozalab yuboradi.','Redis username'=>'Redis foydalanuvchi nomi','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Faqat ACL foydalanuvchilariga ega Redis serveri uchun (Redis 6 yoki undan keyingi versiyalar). Faqat parol bilan kirish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Redis password'=>'Redis paroli','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Agar Redis\'ingiz uchun bu kerak bo\'lmasa, bo\'sh qoldiring.','Key prefix'=>'Kalit prefiksi','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Aloohida ma\'lumotlar bazasi raqami bo\'lmagan holatda uning o\'rnini bosuvchi muqobil variant.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Aqlli avtomatik tozalash','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Kontent o\'zgarganda ta\'sirlangan sahifalarni avtomatik tozalash','After updates'=>'Yangilanishlardan keyin','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Yadro, plagin yoki mavzu yangilanganidan keyin hamma narsani tozalang','After a comment'=>'Izohdan keyin','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Unga yozilgan izoh tasdiqlanganda post sahifasini tozalash','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Uni juda gavjum izohlar bo‘limida o‘chirib qo‘ying, bu yerda u bir soat ichida yuzlab marta bir xil sahifani tozalashi mumkin.','Never cache these'=>'Bularni hech qachon keshlash mumkin emas','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Har doim oqilona WordPress va WooCommerce standartlari qoʻllaniladi — savat, buyurtma berish, mening hisobim va har qanday kirish seansi nima boʻlishidan qatʼiy nazar hech qachon keshlanmaydi.','Addresses'=>'Manzillar','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Har bir qatorda bitta yoʻl, masalan, <code>/basket</code>. Oxiridagi <code>*</code> belgisi uning ostidagi hamma narsaga mos keladi.','Query parameters'=>'So\'rov parametrlari','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ushbu belgiga ega sahifa hech qachon keshlanmaydi — masalan, bir martalik ko‘rib chiqish tokeni.','Cookies'=>'Cookie-fayllar','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Bulardan birini olib yurgan tashrif buyuruvchiga har doim yangi sahifa taqdim etiladi.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Keshdagi barcha sahifalar oʻchirib yuborildi. Ular tashrif buyuruvchilar kelishi bilan qayta tiklanadi.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'Obekt kesh o\'rnatilgan, biroq u hech narsani saqlamayapti.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Sahifa kesh xotirasi yoqilgan, ammo sahifalar hali saqlanmayapti.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress sahifa keshini (page-cache) hali yuklamagan. U keyingi sahifa yuklanishida boshlanadi; aks holda, wp-config.php faylida WP_CACHE qiymati true ekanligini tekshiring.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Obyekt keshi yoqilgan, biroq bu serverda Redis qoʻllab-quvvatlanmaydi.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi o\'rnatilmagan, shuning uchun plagin ishlatib bo\'lmaydi va WordPress o\'zining xotiradagi keshiga o\'tmoqda. Xosting provayderingizdan phpredis\'ni yoqishni so\'rang.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Hech qanday keshlanish amalga oshirilmayapti.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Ikkala kesh ham o\'chirilgan, shuning uchun bu plagin saytni tezlashtirayotgani yo\'q.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ushbu saytda keshlash faol.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis foydalanuvchi nomini yoki parolni rad etdi. wp-config.php faylidagi yoki ushbu ekrandagi Redis hisob maʼlumotlarini tekshiring.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis kirishni qabul qildi, lekin bu saytga oʻz kalitlarini saqlashga ruxsat bermayapti. Redis foydalanuvchisi ushbu saytning kalit prefiksi uchun ruxsatga ega boʻlishi kerak.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis ma\'lumotlar bazasi raqamini rad etdi. Redis ma\'lumotlar bazasi sozlamasini tekshiring.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis xotirasi tugagan va yangi ma\'lumotlarni qabul qilishni rad etmoqda.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi o\'rnatilmagan, shuning uchun WordPress o\'zining xotiradagi keshidan foydalanmoqda. phpredis\'ni yoqishni xosting provayderingizdan so\'rang.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'wp-config.php faylida WP_REDIS_DISABLED o\'rnatilgan, shuning uchun obyekt kesh o\'chirilgan.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Redis serveriga ulanib bo\'lmadi. Redis xosti va portini hamda Redis ishlayotganini tekshiring.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis endigina yozilgan qiymatni qaytarmadi. Redis serverining jurnallarini tekshiring.','Web server'=>'Veb-server','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — sahifalar veb-server tomonidan keshlanadi','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'LiteSpeed emas — sahifalar ushbu plagin yordamida diskda keshlanadi','Pages stored on disk'=>'Diskda saqlangan sahifalar','Redis support'=>'Redis qo‘llab-quvvatlashi','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis o\'rnatilgan','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis oʻrnatilmagan','Page lifetime'=>'Sahifa amal qilish muddati','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Sizga keshni tozalashga ruxsat berilmagan.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Keshni tozalash soʻraldi.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Kesh: boshqa obyekt-kesh plagin o\'rnatilgan, shuning uchun Redis obyekt keshi ushbu plagin tomonidan boshqarilmaydi.','detected'=>'aniqlandi','not detected'=>'aniqlanmadi','phpredis extension missing'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi yoʻq','installed, not storing anything'=>'o‘rnatilgan, hech narsa saqlanmayapti','active, managed by your host'=>'faol, xostingiz tomonidan boshqariladi','active'=>'faol','inactive'=>'faol emas','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed keshi:','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis obyekt keshi:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Redis PHP kengaytmasi (phpredis) bu serverda mavjud emas, shuning uchun obyekt keshini yoqib boʻlmaydi.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Boshqa object-cache drop-in moduli allaqachon o‘rnatilgan. Zinn® object cache\'ni yoqishdan oldin uni olib tashlang.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Redis ulanish konfiguratsiya faylini yozib boʻlmadi.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Birlashtirilgan obyekt-kesh drop-in oʻqib boʻlmadi.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in wp-content ichiga oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in olib tashlab boʻlmadi.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress fayl tizimiga yozib boʻlmaydi, shuning uchun obyekt-kesh drop-in boshqarib boʻlmadi.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Boshqa sahifa kesh plagini wp-content/advanced-cache.php faylini oʻrnatdi. Avval oʻsha plaginni oʻchiring yoki uning sahifa keshidan foydalanishda davom eting.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'`wp-content/cache/zinn-cache` papkasiga yozib bo‘lmadi, shuning uchun sahifalarni keshlab bo‘lmaydi.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php yozib bo\'lmadi, shuning uchun sahifalarni keshlash mumkin emas.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® yangilanish xizmati ushbu yangilanish uchun yuklab olish havolasini taqdim etmadi. Ushbu sayt Zinn® platformasiga ulanish imkoniyatiga ega ekanligini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko\'ring.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Yangilanishni Zinn® yangilash xizmatidan yuklab bo‘lmadi (%s). Bir necha daqiqadan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'ta olmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.','Go Pro'=>'Pro’ga o‘tish','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Kesh tahlili ekrani: xotiraga tushish koeffitsiyenti, xotira, kalitlar va eng sekin kesh buyruqlari.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Mas\'ul plagin yoki mavzu nomini ko\'rsatuvchi sekin so\'rovlar va keshlanmagan chaqiruvlarni aniqlovchi vosita.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Eng qaynoq kalitlar uchun Redis oldida xotiradagi APCu qatlami, shuningdek, oldindan yuklash, siqish va igbinary serializer.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Postlar, terminlar va WooCommerce mahsulotlari uchun teglar asosida tozalash, shunda faqat o\'zgargani tozalanadi, sahifa va obyekt keshlar birgalikda tozalanadi.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Tozalashdan keyin keshni avtomatik qizdirish, WebP va AVIF tasvirlari, ishlatilmagan CSS-ni olib tashlash va kechiktirilgan JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Oldindan ko‘rish imkoniyati bilan rejalashtirilgan ma’lumotlar bazasini tozalash va sahifa bo‘yicha kesh qoidalari.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Kesh nisbati tushib ketganda yoki xotira to\'lganda Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelida kesh salomatligi haqida ogohlantirishlar.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Boshqa barcha yorliqdagi narsalar bepul va shunday bo‘lib qoladi. Pro ushbu plagin ustiga o‘rnatiladi va quyidagilarni qo‘shadi:','See what Pro costs'=>'Pro narxini ko\'rish','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Har bir tarif 14 kunlik bepul sinov muddati bilan boshlanadi, karta talab qilinmaydi: bitta sayt uchun yiliga %1$s, beshta sayt uchun %2$s, cheksiz saytlar uchun %3$s.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php topilmadi, shuning uchun WP_CACHE ni yoqib bo‘lmadi. Unga define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); ni qo‘shing.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php allaqachon WP_CACHE ni false deb belgilagan, shuning uchun sahifa keshini ishga tushirib bo\'lmaydi. Uni true qilib o\'zgartiring.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php yozib bo\'lmaydigan holatda, shuning uchun WP_CACHE ni yoqib bo\'lmadi. Unga define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); ni qo\'shing.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Saqlangan. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi qiymat kiriting.','Filter this list…'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni filtrlash…','Filter this list'=>'Bu ro\'yxatni filtrlash','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Bu filtrga hech narsa mos kelmadi.','Add a row'=>'Qator qo\'shish','Remove this row'=>'Ushbu qatorni olib tashlash','Remove'=>'O\'chirish','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — umumiy ko\'rinish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Copied'=>'Nusxa olindi','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Ushbu saytdagi har bir Zinn® plagin va uning ishlayotgani yoki ishlamayotgani.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Bu plagin uchun ulanish talab qilinmaydi.','Open settings'=>'Sozlamalarni ochish','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalarni oʻzgartirishga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','Settings sections'=>'Sozlamalar bo\'limlari','Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash','Save changes'=>'O‘zgarishlarni saqlash','Tools'=>'Vositalar','Export settings'=>'Sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Reset to defaults'=>'Standart holatga qaytarish','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Bu plagindagi har bir sozlamani standart holatiga qaytaradi. Davom etasizmi?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun diagnostika','Import a settings file'=>'Sozlamalar faylini import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayllarda hech qachon parollar, tokenlar yoki API kalitlari bo\'lmaydi — ularni yangi saytda qaytadan kiritishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalari odatiy holatiga qaytarildi.','Done.'=>'Bajarildi.','That action is not available.'=>'Bu amal bajarib bo\'lmaydi.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Bu faylni o‘qib bo‘lmadi. Zinn® plaginidan eksport qilingan sozlamalar faylini tanlang.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Bu fayl sozlamalar eksporti uchun juda katta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Bu fayl Zinn® sozlamalari eksporti emas.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Bu fayl boshqa plagindan (%s) eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlaydi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.','Connected'=>'Ulangan','Connecting…'=>'Ulanmoqda…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Uzlangan, lekin e\'tibor talab qiladigan narsa bor','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Running on your own account'=>'O\'z hisobingizdan ishlamoqda','We could not check this'=>'Buni tekshira olmadik','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Bu plagin nima sababdan ekanligini ko\'rsatmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz buni ko\'rib chiqamiz.','Connection status'=>'Ulanish holati','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Oxirgi marta %s oldin tekshirilgan.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi tabda ochiladi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuborish','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Yuboriladigan narsa aynan shu — boshqa hech narsa va hech qanday yashirin narsa yo\'q. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz uning ichida emas.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti','Copy to clipboard'=>'Bunker nusxalash','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuboring','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Biz siz uchun yordam so\'rovini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar buni yuborishni xohlamasangiz, uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va o\'zingiz so\'rovga joylashtiring.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotni nusxalab oling va uning o‘rniga murojaat oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xato yo‘q.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi — maʼlumot raqami %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kutib, qayta urinib ko\'ring — avvalgilari yetib kelgan.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® hozircha hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu bizning tomonda, siz tomonda emas. Qisqa vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko‘ring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni tiketga nusxalang.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Hisobot rad etildi (HTTP %d). Uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va shu raqamni keltirgan holda murojaat oching.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Hosting mijozisizmi? %2$s uchun %1$d%% chegirma oling','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Zinn Digital® xosting mijosi sifatida siz birinchi to‘lovingizdan %d%% chegirma olish uchun shaxsiy kodga ega bo‘lasiz. Keyingi to‘lovlar odatdagi narxda amalga oshiriladi.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'%d%% kodimni oling va to\'lov sahifasiga o\'ting','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kechirasiz, buni qilishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Bu chegirma faol va to\'lovi amalga oshirilgan hosting rejasiga ega mijozlar uchun amal qiladi. Bepul sinov muddatlari bunga kirmaydi.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Siz bu plagin uchun hosting mijoziga beriladigan chegirangizdan allaqachon foylangansiz.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kodringizni hozircha olib bo\'lmadi. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq sayt yuritadiganlar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni xarid qiling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','Style preset'=>'Uslub sozlamasi','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Boshlang\'ich nuqta. Undan pastdagi har qanday narsa buni bekor qiladi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'O\'z ranglarim va o\'lchamlarimdan foydalanish','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Buni o\'chirib qo\'ying va andoza o\'z holicha ishlatiladi.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'litsenziya kaliti','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Litsenziya bilan hali foydalanuvchi biriktirilmagan, bu ruxsatsiz faollashtirishning oldini olish uchun zarur. Litsenziyani foydalanuvchingizga tayinlash orqali siz WordPress foydalanuvchingizning to‘liq ismi va elektron pochta manzilini ulashishga rozilik bildirasiz.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'yuqorida tilga olingan saytlar','Account'=>'Hisob','Account Details'=>'Hisob tafsilotlari','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Hisob faollashtirilishini kutmoqda. Hisobingizni faollashtirish uchun elektron pochtangizni tekshiring va havolani bosing, shundan so\'ng sheriklik formasini qaytadan yuboring.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan birlashtirmoqchimisiz?','Actions'=>'Amallar','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Activate Free Version'=>'Bepul versiyani faollashtirish','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','activate a license here'=>'litsenziyani bu yerda faollashtirish','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Iltimos, xarid qilganingizdan keyin darhol elektron pochtangizga kelgan litsenziya kalitini kiriting:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon oʻrnatilgan. %2$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun uni faollashtiring. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s ning pulli versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. Uni faollashtirish va %3$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun %2$s bo\'limiga o\'ting.','Activate this add-on'=>'Ushbu qo‘shimchani faollashtirish','Activate %s'=>'%s ni faollashtirish','Activate %s features'=>'%s funksiyalarini faollashtirish','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'"%s" faollashtirishni hoziroq yakunlash','Activate %s Plan'=>'%s rejasini faollashtirish','Activated'=>'Faollashtirilgan','Activating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Activating license'=>'Litsenziya faollashtirilmoqda','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Hisobingiz %s tarifi bilan muvaffaqiyatli faollashtirildi.','active add-onActive'=>'Faol','Add another domain'=>'Boshqa domen qo\'shish','Add-Ons'=>'Qo\'shimchalar','Add Ons for %s'=>'%s uchun qo‘shimchalar','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Qoʻshimchalar roʻyxatini yuklay olmadik. Bu, ehtimol, biz tomondagi muammo, iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','Add-On'=>'Qo\'shimcha','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s faqat premium qoʻshimcha hisoblanadi. Plaginni faollashtirishdan oldin litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s qo\'shimchasi muvaffaqiyatli sotib olindi.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Sizning %s qo\'shimcha rejangiz muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s bepul sinov muddati muvaffaqiyatli bekor qilindi. Qo\'shimcha faqat premium bo\'lgani sababli, u avtomatik ravishda o\'chirib qo\'yildi. Agar kelajakda undan foydalanishni istasangiz, litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s plaginlarsiz ishlay olmaydi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s siz ishlay olmaydi.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Shunchaki shuni ma\'lum qilamizki, %s ning qo\'shimcha imkoniyatlar haqidagi ma\'lumotlari tashqi serverdan olinmoqda.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'%s modulining qo\'shimchalari','Address'=>'Manzil','Address Line %d'=>'Manzil qatori %d','Affiliate'=>'Hamkor','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Hamkorlik shartlarini buzganligingiz sababli, hamkorlik akkauntingizni vaqtincha bloklashga qaror qildik. Agar savollaringiz bo\'lsa, qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Hamkorlik hisobingiz vaqtincha toʻxtatib turildi.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'%1$s bo\'yicha hamkorlik arizangiz qabul qilindi! Hamkorlik bo\'limiga kiring: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Sheriklik dasturimizga topshirgan arizangiz uchun rahmat, afsuski, bu safar arizangizni rad etishga qaror qildik. Iltimos, 30 kundan keyin yana urinib ko\'ring.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Affiliat dasturimizga ariza topshirganingiz uchun rahmat, biz keyingi 14 kun ichida ma\'lumotlaringizni ko\'rib chiqamiz va qo\'shimcha ma\'lumotlar bilan siz bilan bog\'lanamiz.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Daromad salohiyatini oshirish uchun birinchi tashrifdan keyin %s kuzatuv rejadagi (cookie) fayli.','Affiliation'=>'Hamkorlik','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng siz Free versiyasidan foydalanishda davom etishingiz mumkin, lekin %s funksiyalariga kirish huquqiga ega bo\'lmaysiz.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng, agar uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qayta faollashtirmasangiz, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham barcha %1$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, biroq %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga, shuningdek, qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ega bo‘lmaysiz.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun rahmat.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s davridan keyiniga atigi %2$s toʻlang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani qabul qilish va faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Men roziman - Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha so‘rovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz allaqachon %s ni yaxshilashga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz allaqachon ularni yanada yaxshilashimizga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qo\'llash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarga nisbatan qo\'llash.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo\'lish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlash va sinov muddatini boshlash','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Takomillashishimiz uchun iltimos, sababini bizga ayting.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Yangilash uchun foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni quyida kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini qaytadan yuboramiz.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Xarid qilishda foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini sizga qayta yuboramiz.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Litsenziya egasining hisobiga bog\'lanish.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Muallif','Invalid module ID.'=>'Noto\'g\'ri modul ID raqami.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Premium versiyaga kirish uchun amal qiladigan litsenziyangiz yo‘q.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Avtomatik o‘rnatish faqat ro‘yxatdan o‘tgan foydalanuvchilar uchun ishlaydi.','Premium version already active.'=>'Premial versiya allaqachon faol.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Premium qo\'shimcha versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plagin "Serviceware" hisoblanadi, ya\'ni uning pullik kod versiyasi mavjud emas.','Automatic Installation'=>'Avtomatik oʻrnatish','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Avtomatik o‘chish vaqti:','Average Rating'=>'O\'rtacha reyting','Awesome'=>'Ajoyib','based on %s'=>'%s asosida','Become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo‘lish','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'%s yoqdimi? Bizning elchimiz bo\'ling va pul ishlang ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Salom, %1$s dasturining hamkorlik dasturi borligini bilsarmidingiz? Agar %2$s sizga yoqsa, elchimizga aylanib, pul topishingiz mumkin!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Eng yaxshi','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Beta versiyasiga yangilash %s ning o\'rnatilgan versiyasini eng so\'nggi Beta relizi bilan almashtiradi - ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalaning va uni produktiv saytlarda ishlatmang. Siz ogohlantirildingiz.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'%s bo\'yicha hisoblangan','Billing'=>'Hisob-kitob','Billing & Invoices'=>'Hisob-kitoblar va schyotlar','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Bloklangan','Blocking'=>'Bloklanmoqda','Blog ID'=>'Blog ID','Body'=>'Asosiy qism','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ha - ikkala manzil ham o\'zimniki','Bundle'=>'To\'plam','Bundle Plan'=>'To\'plam rejasi','Business name'=>'Korxona nomi','Buy license'=>'Litsenziyani sotib olish','Buy a license now'=>'Hozir litsenziya sotib oling','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Cancel Installation'=>'Oʻrnatishni bekor qilish','Cancel Subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Agar ushbu %1$s ni ushbu saytda (yoki boshqa biron bir saytda) ishlatishni rejalashtirmayotgan boʻlsangiz, %2$s ni ham bekor qilishni xohlaysizmi?','Cancel Trial'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Sinov davrini bekor qilish barcha premium funksiyalarga kirishni darhol bloklaydi. Ishonchingiz komilmi?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'%s ni bekor qilish va davom etish','Cancelled'=>'Bekor qilingan','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingizni topa olmayapsizmi?','Change License'=>'Litsenziyani oʻzgartirish','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati %s manziliga yuborildi. Siz yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashingiz shart. Agar xatni topa olmasangiz, iltimos, spam papkasini tekshiring.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati hozirgina %s manziliga yuborildi. Xat egasi yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashi shart.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s — hisob raqamining yangi egasi.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Egalik huquqining o\'zgartirilishini tasdiqlaganingiz uchun rahmat. Yakuniy tasdiqlash uchun %s manziliga hozirgina xat yuborildi.','Change Ownership'=>'Egalik huquqini o\'zgartirish','Change Plan'=>'Rejani o\'zgartirish','Change User'=>'Foydalanuvchini oʻzgartirish','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish orqali siz hisob egaligini quyidagiga o\'tkazishga rozilik bildirasiz:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'O‘zgarishlar tarixi','Changing user, please wait'=>'Foydalanuvchi oʻzgartirilmoqda, iltimos kuting','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Agar xat kelmagan bo\'lsa, spam papkasini tekshirib ko\'ring yoki %4$s manzilidan kelgan xatlarni qidiring.','Checkout'=>'Buyurtma berish','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish uchun %s tagacha saytni tanlang.','City'=>'Shahar','Clear API Cache'=>'API keshini tozalash','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Yangilanishlar vaqtincha ma\'lumotlarini tozalash','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Plagindan anonim ravishda foydalanish uchun bu yerni bosing','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'%s reytingini bergan sharhlarni ko\'rish uchun bosing','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s – mijozimning elektron pochta manzili','Code'=>'Kod','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kun saqlab qo‘yilishini hisobga olib, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiya to‘lovlarini amalga oshiramiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s versiyasiga yanginganingiz uchun rahmat!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta’limiy kontent va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida ayrim ma’lumotlarni ulashish uchun rozilik bildiring. Bu bizga %s\'ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta\'limiy kontent hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo\'yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda ba\'zi asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro\'yxatdan o\'ting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Biz ushbu qo‘shilish imkoniyatini taqdim etdik, shunda siz hech qanday muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormaysiz va %s vositasini veb-saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishimizda hamda sizga kerakli vazifalarni bajarishda yaxshiroq ishlashiga yordam berasiz.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Biz Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyani taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi hali faollashtirilmagan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar bu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulangan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qaytadan faollashtiring.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha siz bilan bog‘lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Nogulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us here'=>'Iltimos, bu yerda biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, biz bilan quyidagi xabar orqali bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Kron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'API so\'rovlari uchun biz PHP cURL kutubxonasidan foydalanamiz, bu juda keng tarqalgan kutubxona bo\'lib, odatda o\'rnatilgan va sukut bo\'yicha faollashtirilgan bo\'ladi. Afsuski, serveringizda cURL faollashtirilmagan (yoki o\'chirilgan).','data'=>'ma\'lumotlar','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish rejimi muvaffaqiyatli yoqildi va 60 daqiqadan so\'ng avtomatik ravishda o\'chiriladi. Shuningdek, "Stop Debug" havolasini bosish orqali uni erta o\'chirishingiz mumkin.','Date'=>'Sana','Deactivate'=>'Faolsizlantirish','Deactivate the free version'=>'Bepul versiyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivate License'=>'Litsenziyani faolsizlantirish','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Litsenziyangizni faolsizlantirish barcha premium funksiyalarni bloklaydi, lekin litsenziyani boshqa saytda faollashtirish imkonini beradi. Davom etishni xohlayotganingizga aminmisiz?','Deactivation'=>'Faollashtirni bekor qilish','Yes - %s'=>'Ha - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Yuborish va %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s ni o\'chirish yoki olib tashlash litsenziyani avtomatik ravishda faolsizlantiradi, uni boshqa saytda ishlatishingiz mumkin bo\'ladi.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Agar vaqtingiz bo\'lsa, iltimos, nima uchun %s ekanligingizni bizga xabar bering','Debug Log'=>'Nosozliklarni tuzatish jurnali','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Nosozliklarni bartaraf etish','delegate'=>'delegat qilish','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Agar uni bossangiz, bu qaror sayt ma\'muriyatiga yuklatiladi.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Sayt administratorlariga o‘tkazish','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Sayt administratorlariga o‘tkazish va davom etish','Delegating, please wait'=>'Delegatsiya qilinmoqda, iltimos kuting','verbDelete'=>'O\'chirish','Delete All Accounts'=>'Barcha hisoblarni oʻchirish','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Barcha Freemius maʼlumotlarini 