si','%s ratings'=>'%s ta baho','%s sec'=>'%s soniya','%s star'=>'%s yulduzcha','%s stars'=>'%s ta yulduz','%s time'=>'%s vaqt','%s times'=>'%s marta','You have successfully updated your %s.'=>'Siz %s muvaffaqiyatli yangiladingiz.','as annual periodyear'=>'yil','interjection expressing joy or exuberanceYee-haw'=>'Yee-haw','Yes'=>'Ha','You are all good!'=>'Barchasi joyida!','You are just one step away - %s'=>'Siz atigi bir qadam uzoqdasiz - %s','Seems like you got the latest release.'=>'Siz oxirgi relizni olganga o\'xshaysiz.','You should receive %3$s for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s in the next 5 minutes.'=>'Keyingi 5 daqiqa ichida %2$s manzilidagi pochta qutingizga %1$s uchun %3$s kelishi kerak.','ZIP / Postal Code'=>'Pochta indeksi',' %1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s versiya %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlashdan foydalanish uchun.','%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s avtomatik xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda pullik funksionallik %2$s gacha (yoki litsenziyangiz muddati tugaguncha, qaysi biri oldinroq sodir bo\'lishiga qarab) uzluksiz ishlashda davom etadi.','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s versiya %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlashdan foydalanish uchun.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Foydalanuvchining beta rejimini oʻrnatishga urinish vaqtida nomaʼlum xatolik yuz berdi.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Litsenziyaning oq yorliq (white-label) rejimini yoqish/o‘chirishga harakat qilishda nomaʼlum xatolik yuz berdi.','Annual'=>'Yillik','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'"Voz kechish" tugmasini bosish orqali %s endi ismingiz va elektron pochtangizni ko\'ra olmaydi.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'"Opt Out" tugmasini bosish orqali diagnostika ma\'lumotlari endi %s ga yuborilmaydi.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Veb-saytni uzish orqali %1$s haqida ilgari ulashilgan diagnostika maʼlumotlari oʻchirib yuboriladi va %2$s uchun endi koʻrinmaydi.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Ushbu ma\'lumotni yangilanishlar serveri bilan ulashishdan voz kechib, siz %1$s ning yangi versiyalarini o\'zingiz tekshirishingiz, ularni qo\'lda yuklab olishingiz va o\'rnatishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Bu nafaqat noqulaylik tug\'diradi, balki yangilanishni o\'tkazib yuborish veb-saytingizni xavf ostiga qo\'yishi va keraksiz moslik muammolarini keltirib chiqarishi mumkin, shuning uchun ushbu muhim ruxsatnomalarni yoqilgan holda qoldirishingizni qat\'iy tavsiya qilamiz.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'%1$s ni bekor qilish - Men %3$s ni ushbu yoki boshqa biron bir saytda ishlatishni rejalashtirmaganim uchun %2$s uchun xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlashga bo‘lgan ehtiyojim qolmadi.','Cancel %s?'=>'%s ni bekor qilish mumkinmi?','Cancelling %s'=>'%s bekor qilinmoqda','Cancelling %s...'=>'%s bekor qilinmoqda...','Click here'=>'Bu yerga bosing','Deactivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Veb-saytni uzish Foydalanuvchi Boshqaruv Panelidagi hisobingizdan %s ni butunlay o‘chirib tashlaydi.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini avtomatik yetkazib berish hamda litsenziyani boshqarish va himoya qilish uchun %s quyidagilarni bajarishi kerak:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlarni yetkazib berish hamda litsenziyani boshqarish uchun %s quyidagilarga muhtoj:','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius bu bizning litsenziyalash va dasturiy ta\'minot yangilanishlari mexanizmimizdir','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Agar bu uzoq muddatli dublikat bo\'lsa, %1$s dan keyin avtomatik yangilanishlar va pullik funksionallikni saqlab qolish uchun %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'%2$s %4$s ning dublikati mi?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Beta dasturiga qo\'shilish','Join the Beta program'=>'Beta dasturiga qo\'shilish','License'=>'Litsenziya','License Key'=>'Litsenziya kaliti','License key'=>'Litsenziya kaliti','Monthly'=>'Oylik','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Nomi, sluglar, versiyalar va ular faol yoki faol emasligi','New Version Available'=>'Yangi versiya mavjud','Optional'=>'Ixtiyoriy','Plan'=>'Reja','Products'=>'Mahsulotlar','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini ulash veb-saytingizga mos keladigan qo\'shimcha funksionallikni taqdim etishga, veb-sayt ishdan chiqishiga olib kelishi mumkin bo\'lgan WordPress yoki PHP versiyalarining mos kelmasligining oldini olishga hamda %s qaysi tillar va mintaqalarga tarjima qilinishi va moslashtirilishi kerakligini aniqlashga yordam beradi.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Shuning uchun %s faol bo\'lmaganda litsenziyani qayta ishlatishingiz mumkin.','Subscription'=>'Obuna','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini tekshirish hamda litsenziyangiz haqiqiyligini tasdiqlash uchun vaqti-vaqti bilan %2$sga muhim litsenziya maʼlumotlarini yuborib turadi.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%2$s dan %1$s mavjud.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'O‘rnatilgan plaginlar va themelar bilan moslikni ta\'minlash va ziddiyatlarning oldini olish uchun.','Trial'=>'Sinov muddati','View %s State'=>'%s holatini ko\'rish','View Basic %s Info'=>'Asosiy %s maʼlumotlarini koʻrish','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ha, sinov, steyjing yoki dasturlash maqsadida %2$s bu %4$s nusxasidir.','You have a %s license.'=>'Sizda %s litsenziya mavjud.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Siz %s litsenziyasini sotib oldingiz.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'%1$s uchun tasdiqlovchi xat %2$s manzilidagi pochta qutingizga kelishi kerak. %3$s uchun iltimos, ushbu xatdagi tugmani bosganingizga ishonch hosil qiling.','days'=>'kun','deactivating'=>'faoliyatsizlashtirilmoqda','hour'=>'soat','hours'=>'soat','license'=>'litsenziya','optional'=>'ixtiyoriy','products'=>'Mahsulotlar','skip'=>'oʻtkazib yuborish','subscription'=>'obuna','trial'=>'Sinov muddati','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Mahsulotlar','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','as software licenseLicense'=>'Litsenziya','close a windowDismiss'=>'Yopish','close windowDismiss'=>'Yopish','like websitesSites'=>'Saytlar','nounPricing'=>'Narxlar','trial periodTrial'=>'Sinov muddati','verbOpt In'=>'Obuna bo‘lish','verbOpt Out'=>'Voz kechish','verbSkip'=>'Oʻtkazib yuborish','verbUpgrade'=>'Yangilash','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s oldin','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Amalni bajarib bo‘lmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring, agar xatolik takrorlanaversa, sayt maʼmuriga murojaat qiling.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Kerakli qiymat yo\'q yoki noto\'g\'ri shaklda. Funksiyaning kirish sxemasini tekshiring.','The site refused the request.'=>'Sayt so‘rovni rad etdi.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Claude, Cursor yoki VS Code kabi sun\'iy intellekt yordamchilariga MCP (Model Context Protocol) orqali ushbu saytda ishlashiga ruxsat bering. Ular dasturiy parolga ega WordPress foydalanuvchisi sifatida tizimga kiradi va faqat o‘sha foydalanuvchiga ruxsat etilgan amallarni bajarishi mumkin.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt agentlari uchun WordPress 6.9 yoki undan keyingi versiyasi talab qilinadi. Ulardan foydalanish uchun WordPress\'ni yangilang.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'U ulanish manzili (MCP yakuniy nuqtasi)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Foydalanuvchingiz uchun dastur parolini yarating','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Buni foydalanuvchi nomingiz va ushbu parol bilan birga sun\'iy intellekt ilovangizning MCP sozlamalariga qo\'shing:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: bir xil yozuvni "mcpServers" ostiga emas, balki .vscode/mcp.json faylidagi "servers" ostiga qo\'ying.','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Bu yerda sun\'iy intellekt agenti foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan vositalar (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasi: AI agentlari va MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dasturchi hujjatlari: imkoniyatlar, REST va MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Zinn® Cache yordamida ushbu sayt keshini tekshiring va tozalang hamda uning kesh sozlamalarini o‘zgartiring.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Sahifa va obyekt keshi holati, tozalash va sozlamalar.','Read the cache status'=>'Kesh holatini oʻqish','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Sahifa kesh va obyekt kesh yoqilgan va ishlayotganini, qancha sahifa keshga olinganini hamda obyekt keshning ulanish va hit ko\'rsatkichlarini qaytaradi.','Read the cache settings'=>'Kesh sozlamalarini o\'qish','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Barcha kesh sozlamalarini qaytaradi. Redis paroli hech qachon qaytarilmaydi, faqat uning saqlangan yoki saqlanmagani ko‘rsatiladi.','Change the cache settings'=>'Kesh sozlamalarini o\'zgartirish','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Siz yuborgan sozlamalarni o\'zgartiradi va qolganlarini (sahifa keshini, sahifalar qancha vaqt keshda saqlanishini, obyekt keshini va uning Redis ulanishini, tozalash qoidalari va istisnolarini) saqlab qoladi. Qiymatlar Kesh ekranidagi kabi tekshiriladi va to\'g\'rilanadi.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Kesh sozlamalarini standart holatiga qaytarish','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'Tiklash tugmasi kabi, har bir kesh sozlamasini o\'chi holatiga qaytaradi. Saqlangan Redis paroli ham o\'chiriladi.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Diagnostika hisobotini o‘qish','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati so‘ragan diagnostika hisobotini qaytaradi: versiyalar, server cheklovlari, kesh holati va oxirgi xatolar. Unda parollar yoki kalitlar saqlanmaydi.','Purge the cache'=>'Keshni tozalash','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Keshdan saqlangan sahifalarni o\'chirib tashlaydi: hammasi (all: true), ayrim manzillar (urls) yoki teglangan barcha sahifalar (tags). Sahifalar tashrif buyuruvchilar kelishi bilan qayta tuziladi.']];